Description: methylTFR is a comprehensive R package tailored for the
    analysis of DNA methylation patterns within transcription factor
    binding sites (TFBS) across various genomic annotations. methylTFR
    enhances methylation analysis by computing, for each TFBS and each
    cell or sample, a bias-corrected "deviation" in methylation levels
    from the expected methylation for each motif, utilizing the GC bias
    distribution and frequency data. The package provides a range of
    functions aiding in the discovery of TFBS with varying methylation
    patterns across different samples or cells.
